    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just hard to see the point in trying to fix a house that’s already hollow. everything i used to care about, all the parts of me that made me... me... they're just gone. it's like i'm watching a movie of my life but i'm not even in the scenes anymore. i'm just a ghost waiting for the power to be cut.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
